 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Abraham took another wife named Keturah",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.41,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "She bore him sons of a different line",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.22,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Midian was born before the end came",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.37,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "One of the six who were his",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.47,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He gave everything he owned to Isaac",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.4,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But to the sons of his concubines he gave gifts",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.56,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "While he was still alive he sent them away",
   "heard": 9,
